What:		/proc/task_info/task_sched_info/sched_stats
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Read-only containment and activity counters for the ColorOS task
		scheduler telemetry port.  The file reports whether recording and
		uevent notification are enabled, record/ring-overrun counts,
		coalesced/suppressed notification counts, uevent count, deferred
		backtrace queue/drop counts, and the last producer type/CPU.

		The interface is diagnostic only.  Writing is not supported and
		counter values must not be used as a scheduler control ABI.

What:		/proc/task_info/task_sched_info/sched_info_threshold
Date:		September 2026
Contact:	Miru H.40 kernel maintainers
Description:
		Five nanosecond thresholds for running, runnable, block/IO, D, and
		S telemetry records.  Each supplied threshold must be at least
		4,000,000 ns, matching the Android 14 OnePlus 9R donor floor.
		Smaller values fail with ERANGE.
